# Frontend & UI/UX Rules

1. Follow `docs/DESIGN.md` design system tokens.
2. Provide loading (Skeleton), error, and empty states for every data display component.
3. Use accessible color contrast (WCAG AA).
4. Responsive design first: Test on mobile (375px), tablet (768px), and desktop (1440px).
5. Anti-AI slop: Write natural, crisp medical verifier copy.
6. Feedback: Show Sonner toast notifications for user actions (submit, approve, reject).
